“Bhai sach bolu…
maine bhi starting me bohot videos daali thi,
views aate hi nahi the.
Tab lagta tha shayad content hi bekaar hai.

Par baad me samajh aaya…
problem content nahi thi,
problem thi algorithm ko na samajhna.

YouTube actually simple hai, bas hum use galat tarike se use karte hain.”

“Sabse pehli cheez jo maine notice ki…
YouTube ye dekhta hai ki banda video pe ruk raha hai ya nahi.

Matlab agar koi first 20–30 second me hi nikal gaya,
toh YouTube bol deta hai —
‘chhod bhai, is video ko push nahi karna.’

Isliye shuru me directly point pe aana padta hai.
No ‘hello guys welcome back’ type stuff.”

“Phir aata hai watch time.
Views ka utna scene nahi hai jitna log sochte hain.

Agar 100 log poori video dekh rahe hain,
toh wo 100 log 1000 se zyada powerful hote hain
jo 10 second me nikal jaate hain.”

“Ek cheez jo mujhe personally kaafi help kari —
thumbnail aur title.

Bhai agar click hi nahi hoga,
toh video chahe kitni bhi achi ho, koi nahi dekhega.

Simple sa rule hai —
title curiosity create kare,
thumbnail emotion dikhaye.”

“Consistency bhi kaafi matter karti hai.
Roz video daalna zaroori nahi,
par randomly mat daalo.

YouTube ko samajhna hota hai
ki tu kis type ka creator hai.”

“Shorts ko bhi ignore mat karo.
Maine khud dekha hai,
ek short viral hota hai
aur poora channel upar chala jaata hai.

Bas long video ka ek solid part uthao
aur short bana do.”

“Last cheez — engagement.
Log comment karte hain, like karte hain,
toh YouTube ko signal milta hai
ki haan, log interested hain.

Isliye main hamesha bolta hoon —
agar video thodi si bhi useful lagi ho,
toh comment karke bata do.”

“Bas bhai, itna hi.
Agar tum chahte ho main next video me
content ideas, thumbnail kaise banate hain
ya niche selection pe baat karu…

toh comment me likh dena ‘NEXT’.
Aur haan, subscribe kar lena —
main yahan fake gyaan nahi deta.”
